Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Settings: Add SBC HD Developer Options toggles

Add two new toggles in Developer Options for SBC HD audio:
- Enable SBC HD audio: Enables Dual Channel mode with higher bitrates
- Force max SBC HD bitrate: Forces 551 kbps even without 3Mbps EDR

Both settings require toggling Bluetooth to take effect.

Change-Id: I339d6055c1cb78f38e90561ea8e77ea528ce095e
---
