 ...uetoothSbcHdForceMaxBitrateController.java | 71 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../BluetoothSbcHdPreferenceController.java   | 71 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../DevelopmentSettingsDashboardFragment.java |  2 +
 4 files changed, 154 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/development/BluetoothSbcHdForceMaxBitrateController.java
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/development/BluetoothSbcHdPreferenceController.java

